{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7d8752725f000e2f1b9d1b9820fa66726b359d6943475f372470d888ebcc7c23", "ja": "（育は今、小学校低学年向けの番組に、\nマンスリーゲストとして出演している）", "zh": "（育现在正在一档面向小学低年级学生的节目中，作为每月嘉宾出演。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d41e549a810023cd9562a956d3a4a0488bb1a8137caa8f02e92f67d5fcae5e54", "ja": "（「レギュラーのみんなより、少し年上のお姉さん」\n……お姉さん志向の育には、ピッタリの仕事だな）", "zh": "（“比常驻成员们稍微年长一些的大姐姐”……这份工作很适合憧憬大姐姐的育呢）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "a49e63c64ac94c16141fc940b67a77fa2426903951268fafee6d6a9e66b144f5", "ja": "おうくんは、石油王くん！", "zh": "王君就是石油王君！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "4598964e4e2eb4fb82e37f8aab30fea63eb23cd0b1772a85e4030ff6bd796b2a", "ja": "石油王くん！？", "zh": "石油王君！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "4598964e4e2eb4fb82e37f8aab30fea63eb23cd0b1772a85e4030ff6bd796b2a", "ja": "石油王くん！？", "zh": "石油王君！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "cf362d1d388629b88ed848fab5472b95476a1a16ecd8228f91111266b09d8b65", "ja": "あのね、むかし『石油王』って呼ばれてた、\nすっごく有名な人がいるんだって。", "zh": "我说啊，听说以前有位被称为“石油王”、\n非常非常有名的人哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "382ea8b17413dc0728c731542e9157d6fa434ebd3e90bd5ad90ca83200b88bf1", "ja": "石油をほり起こしたあと、いろんな事業を始めて、\nすっごくお金持ちになった、すごい人なんだって！", "zh": "据说他在开采石油之后，又开创了各种各样的事业，\n变得超级有钱，是个了不起的人呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "a8f737ba3fc804f1251b6e2bd2755a251620d6a45ad05e2e27e1f7f386f36ac7", "ja": "知ってるわ。\n引退する前から、慈善活動でも有名よね。", "zh": "我知道。\n在退休之前，他在慈善活动方面也很有名呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "39f2fb52b3e4140250b1cf0005276705430fd689681f221cf17e0d0a9953a949", "ja": "そうなの！　その人みたいに立派な人に\nなれますようにって、おとうさんがつけたんだって。", "zh": "是这样的！听说爸爸给她取这个名字，就是希望她能成为像那个人一样了不起的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "e98ca5e709da18e04d23003fdaf2d2e9a2a79901c3cf676fafd1f57e0ea47be5", "ja": "なるほど～。立派で、\n大きな夢を抱けそうな名前ですね～。", "zh": "原来如此～。真是个让人觉得能怀抱远大梦想的好名字呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "9f5f5ee1b1a99eb45bf47260b2530addf6256393e9f3365152db56a30f1d984d", "ja": "すごくこせい的だよね。でもわたしは、\n律子さんも美也さんも、すてきな名前だと思うな！", "zh": "非常有个性呢。不过我觉得，律子姐姐和美也姐姐的名字都很棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "8d1ece8a7bca9e60aff0205a6330c528e4ba00292cffc61ebf543466a424c729", "ja": "あら、ありがとう！　そうね、いかにも\n私らしい名前で、自分でも気に入ってるわ。", "zh": "哎呀，谢谢！确实是个非常符合我风格的名字，我自己也很喜欢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "83ebd190d32592dac5504a41c65a10c7db2f2bb939fd054e5b1f51dbb04e3736", "ja": "私も、自分の名前が気に入っていますよ～♪\nみやおみや、とっても覚えやすい名前ですよね～。", "zh": "我也很喜欢自己的名字哦～♪“宫尾美也”，是个特别好记的名字吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1013_se", "source_sha256": "c01f9901aa06ad650b314d5a929022d1574a5f17402b31fd5bd6359592e719d6", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f49fca143d2bcdb1fd92cf71e238b07db2f2ca85e024a983024838710dedf183", "ja": "育、律子、美也。\nみんな揃ってたんだな、お疲れ様！", "zh": "育、律子、美也，大家都到齐了啊，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "e45ae029ae10ce20a7a196fd348011757191e4f5db0afdc415628b4237f69fcc", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\n海美さんと杏奈さんも、おつかれさま！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n海美和杏奈，你们也辛苦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "c43983d598112d4f03763785cbb353edf8506ec995c08c7b81fcdc2d0a28c402", "ja": "おつかれさま、育りん！　ねえねえ、\n今なんか、楽しそうな話してなかった！？", "zh": "辛苦了，育琳！喂喂，刚才是不是在聊什么有趣的事！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "13a4cd71c0f70532b2556ac68d884a56c29d1f045c0a9520e1a7bef75719dfee", "ja": "石油王……？とか、お金持ちって、聞こえた……。\n……ボドゲ……？", "zh": "石油大亨……？还有什么有钱人……，我好像听到了……。\n……桌游……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1018_p", "source_sha256": "dc428feb2a9a7880c594b23699bc695c7e029c640768f3ca7cfbd604835bd6b4", "ja": "そういえば『小学生わいわいわーい！』に\n出演している男の子に、そんな名前の子がいたな……。", "zh": "说起来，《小学生欢欢乐乐！》里出演的男孩子中，好像就有个叫这个名字的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "b251063b7862a21d05595017ea57367ed8fc2af4f4dc87ad1384c5eed33a0f93", "ja": "{$P$}、知ってたんですか？\n石油王くんなんて、ずいぶん個性的な名前ですよね。", "zh": "{$P$}，你知道吗？\n石油王同学，这名字还真是够有个性的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "1d1e12d4494a6a745387c2c75091f9cb3355218cdc3cae360b567be42d90c51f", "ja": "『小学生わいわいわーい！』って、\n育りんが出てる番組だよね？", "zh": "《小学生欢欢闹闹！》就是育酱参加的节目吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "bb3eb9e67ff87d5d30fb71c5aa3c333ef3032067fc79152e7f7bf14bdb6c8486", "ja": "そう！　期間げんていの、\nじゅんレギュラーだよ！", "zh": "对！是期间限定的特邀常驻嘉宾哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1022_p", "source_sha256": "a906dec0a298a9d275392d23076e73beb77849f4ab97e0d07876421570ba3785", "ja": "レギュラーメンバーは小学校低学年の子だけで、\n育はお姉さんポジションのマンスリーゲストなんだ。", "zh": "固定成员都是小学低年级的孩子，育则是以大姐姐身份登场的每月嘉宾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "dcece0d9e44c49a0b4f823e2b46e8aaafeb7968bef031fa36fd4c4dbb9e21046", "ja": "へーっ、そうなんだ！　じゃあその番組では、\nお姉さんの育りんが見られるんだね☆", "zh": "诶——原来是这样！那么在那个节目里，就能看到姐姐定位的育琳了呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1024_024ann", "source_sha256": "a771d3cf704242eb8a1e9b61cd0b55e0e6f854ec333f5e4b2bdb6f7068aff198", "ja": "杏奈も……小さいころ、観てた……。\nゲームのコーナー……好き……。", "zh": "杏奈小时候……也看过……。  \n喜欢节目里的游戏环节……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1025_030iku", "source_sha256": "04723017dabea4a6467bd899d05001f3651f5bff5b21cd58c1334c76ec609052", "ja": "そうなの？　じゃあ杏奈さん、わたしが出てる\n『わいわいわーい！』も、観てね！", "zh": "这样啊？那杏奈姐姐，也要记得看我参加的《欢欢乐乐！》哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1026_024ann", "source_sha256": "31722496d6a55c992c093ff26cad0d7522f4d4dded30a87f7ab5c50a60e29e76", "ja": "ん……観る……。\n楽しみ……。", "zh": "嗯……会看的……。\n很期待……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1027_p", "source_sha256": "54322eb0990e67e2ed7ca89d171412e791e45c547b5f54f5479e8278ae2a095b", "ja": "番組出演で注目されてる事だし、今度の定期公演は\n育がセンターで行こうと思ってるんだ。", "zh": "既然上节目让育受到了关注，下一次定期公演就让育来担任中心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1028_p", "source_sha256": "5f2942197d9b8c1d4e2de94d10048480e44c7ffb9e396c5a767cd42046890caa", "ja": "最終出演予定の次の週末が、定期公演だ。\n少し忙しくなるけど……どうだ？　育。", "zh": "最终出演预定的下一个周末，正好是定期公演。\n会稍微忙一些，不过……你觉得怎么样？育。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1029_030iku", "source_sha256": "8b27c97c4d5b2a331f1ac7825874345394c610229f6b82f75bee490cd81b7412", "ja": "もちろんやるよ、{$P$}さん！\nわたしにまかせて！", "zh": "当然要参加啦，{$P$}先生！\n就包在我身上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1030_030iku", "source_sha256": "fa06a41b8155eded6e0492ea0fe0e4df6bf816cec363707a857fed4f588107d2", "ja": "それで『わいわいわーい！』のみんなにも、\nわたしがアイドルやってるところを観てもらうんだ♪", "zh": "这样一来，也能让《哇～哇～哇～！》的大家看看我当偶像的样子啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1031_p", "source_sha256": "5bef4b8b94e433d8beac35f3b9ed40a1e6ea68443cba4c491ba531c8761689ea", "ja": "うん、そうだな。番組で共演したみんなも、\nアイドルに興味を持ってくれるかもしれない。", "zh": "嗯，确实。在节目里合作过的大家，\n说不定也会对偶像产生兴趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1032_030iku", "source_sha256": "21841404fb3d1f27d719ffb4a041babd480d6c7072de8f60983a1366f55ae30b", "ja": "あっ……でも、最終出演のあとだよね？\nそれだと、りーふちゃんは来られないかな……。", "zh": "啊……不过是在最后一次出演之后吧？\n那样的话，莉芙可能就来不了了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1033_024ann", "source_sha256": "1b8cf74f12e04b2bef31d21cba4fea513c305cc0f07ba0a4a5fc752b0ea40980", "ja": "りーふちゃん……この、写真の子……？\n来られない……どうして……？", "zh": "莉芙……是照片里的这个孩子吗……？\n来不了……为什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1034_030iku", "source_sha256": "ce0a43c2006783ecb7b7187ee2d00058cff985490f401df8a8a3ae0ea5e4ceaf", "ja": "うん。りーふちゃん、おとうさんのお仕事の都合で、\n海外に引っ越すことが決まってるんだって。", "zh": "嗯。听说莉芙因为爸爸工作的原因，已经决定要搬到国外去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1035_030iku", "source_sha256": "ab8831ccc006604e29560cf298b7f709a8c9466734b4cee3214db0de0298da5b", "ja": "だから番組も、あとすこしで卒業なんだ……。\nせっかく、仲良くなれたのに……。", "zh": "所以，节目也快要结束了……。\n好不容易才变得要好……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1036_042miy", "source_sha256": "de3c2f131832d648b2a73dc70a837484689f69e9ca1108c418d4d0d18830e15e", "ja": "なんと～。それは寂しいですな～。", "zh": "真是的～那可真寂寞啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1037_p", "source_sha256": "24054736e09fec29fc8ae6e781c4ac7a36964a8af54258331b1303c18687e37d", "ja": "小学生だからな……。親の都合に左右されるのは\n仕方がないとはいえ、りーふちゃんは辛いだろうな。", "zh": "毕竟还是个小学生啊……虽说这也是\n受父母的情况左右没办法的事，但莉芙心里肯定很难受吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1038_p", "source_sha256": "9624cdcd2f53714af8bf16b8030e58a6385b83fe696aea566abbf29a715c92e3", "ja": "でも今度、出演者のみんなで、りーふちゃんの\nお別れパーティーをするんだって聞いたけど。", "zh": "不过，我听说下次所有出演者要一起给里芙办送别会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1039_030iku", "source_sha256": "889f9c8756dd64859b8388630b933efd73793a8e6fa54cad6023be893ed62da5", "ja": "うん！　みんなで色紙を書いて、\nりーふちゃんにプレゼントする予定なんだよ。", "zh": "嗯！我们打算让大家一起在留言板上写寄语，然后送给小莉芙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1040_030iku", "source_sha256": "38759c3e1bf36941fbea423cfebe1936662387ebe237a00c2e5023951984139d", "ja": "色紙係は、わたしがやることになったの。\n全員に書いてもらわなくちゃ！", "zh": "色纸这边由我来负责。\n得让所有人都写才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1041_009rit", "source_sha256": "a9fa658bba1456610d01f787d90f172c7f08db55e316f436059c9f766eed9e11", "ja": "素敵じゃない。仲良しのみんなからだもの、\nきっと喜んでくれるわよ。", "zh": "这不是很棒嘛。毕竟是来自关系要好的大家的礼物，她一定会很高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1042_029umi", "source_sha256": "ea3cae51079eef17bbbd86878abcfd580ec1afe1f107b18546066b97e09783c2", "ja": "お別れは寂しいけど……ちょっとでも、\nいい思い出になるといいね！", "zh": "虽然分别让人有些寂寞……但希望至少能成为一段美好的回忆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1043_030iku", "source_sha256": "f9c0f67e51b2a4533e89e5615ba54359393c93b06eecc910dc6386f39c43a43a", "ja": "うん！　あっ、それで思い出した。\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "嗯！啊，说到这个我想起来了。{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1044_030iku", "source_sha256": "ff81435c97b2f8163bb100cdee319305162e31c522a4cf46f5d9c1598b22822e", "ja": "色紙を買いたいから、お買い物につきあってくれる？\nあとね、かわいいシールも買いたいんだ！", "zh": "我想买色纸，你能陪我去买东西吗？还有啊，我还想买可爱的贴纸！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1045_p", "source_sha256": "aba091d564fe6f1b752df34beeafa87e920703ef7e0be2bbf836a2822889aaf2", "ja": "もちろん。それじゃ、今度の収録前に、\nショッピングモールに寄って行こうか。", "zh": "当然可以。那下次录制前，\n一起去购物中心逛逛吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_163_1046_030iku", "source_sha256": "9910937385366c997db207743c92c0e9e66722798425de4d0e1c2ae77cef0451", "ja": "ありがとう！\nかわいい色紙があるといいな～。", "zh": "谢谢！\n要是能买到可爱的色纸就好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
